
Resources Directory Structure

Skins Diffusion expects a specific resource layout extracted from the 
game client. Place all required files inside the `Resources/` directory 
while preserving the original folder hierarchy.

skins-diffusion-starter/
├── Resources/
│   ├── Ages/
│   │   └── Prefab_Characters/
│   │       └── Prefab_Hero/
│   │           ├── Actor_<XXX>_Actions.pkg.bytes
│   │           ├── ...
│   │           └── CommonActions.pkg.bytes
│   ├── AssetRefs/
│   │   └── Hero/
│   │       ├── <XXX>_AssetRef.bytes
│   │       └── ...
│   ├── Databin/
│   │   └── Client/
│   │       ├── Actor/
│   │       │   └── heroSkin.bytes
│   │       ├── Shop/
│   │       │   └── HeroSkinShop.bytes
│   │       ├── Skill/
│   │       │   ├── liteBulletCfg.bytes 
│   │       │   └── skillmark.bytes
│   │       └── Sound/
│   │           ├── BattleBank.bytes 
│   │           ├── ChatSound.bytes 
│   │           ├── HeroSound.bytes 
│   │           ├── LobbyBank.bytes 
│   │           └── LobbySound.bytes 
│   └── Prefab_Characters/
│       ├── Actor_<XXX>_Infos.pkg.bytes
│       └── ...


Usage
-----

1. Extract the required game files.
2. Place them in the `Resources/` directory following the structure shown above.


Note
----

1. The directory structure must be preserved exactly as shown above.
2. Missing resource files may cause processing failures or incomplete modifications.
3. `<XXX>` represents a hero ID.